WEBVTT

02:22.600 --> 02:26.560
<i>Episode 4 Broken Stone.</i>

02:42.530 --> 02:46.010
Huh, that was easy!

02:46.040 --> 02:49.300
As I thought, this is
some incredible treasure.

02:49.330 --> 02:51.960
I hope you won't hate
me for this, Miss Shigure.

02:56.130 --> 02:57.130
Who's that?

03:05.260 --> 03:06.310
Ouch!

03:17.820 --> 03:21.950
I gave this to
the girl, not you.

03:22.740 --> 03:24.160
I'm taking it back.

03:24.830 --> 03:26.740
Right, old man?

03:29.960 --> 03:31.620
You knew I was here.

03:32.500 --> 03:33.580
Dakuan!

03:38.380 --> 03:42.940
I was taking an evening stroll
and I just happened to walk by here.

03:42.970 --> 03:45.800
Jeez! I can't trust anyone!

03:47.220 --> 03:49.400
You are full of it, old man.

03:49.430 --> 03:51.730
I know you've been
following me all along.

03:54.230 --> 03:59.080
You go back to Miss Shigure
and mind the fire like a good kid.

03:59.110 --> 04:02.170
Okay, Okay"- Hey, Jubei.

04:02.200 --> 04:03.860
I'll get you for this.

04:07.780 --> 04:10.220
The wind has
changed its direction.

04:10.250 --> 04:13.090
The smell of sulfur
is stronger now.

04:13.120 --> 04:15.260
How about it, Jubei?

04:15.290 --> 04:18.130
Will you be her bodyguard?

04:18.960 --> 04:22.670
You can take care of her alone.

04:23.220 --> 04:26.340
Who is she anyway,
that girl Shigure?

04:28.140 --> 04:30.390
Well, she is...

05:25.740 --> 05:28.030
Oh, my, what is it?

05:39.040 --> 05:40.040
JubeL.

05:41.460 --> 05:42.920
I will get it back.

05:46.970 --> 05:49.550
Please get it back, Jubei.

06:43.770 --> 06:45.320
A m-monster!

07:24.560 --> 07:27.660
It doesn't look like you
were manipulating that root.

07:27.690 --> 07:31.030
I won't let you move
one step further.

07:52.260 --> 07:53.260
What?

08:05.440 --> 08:09.400
Such a blow has
no effect on my body.

08:24.670 --> 08:26.140
No use running away.

08:26.170 --> 08:30.590
Give me back the other half of the Sacred
Dragon Stone and I will spare your life.

08:31.510 --> 08:33.020
Well, well.

08:33.050 --> 08:36.060
For someone who looks like
you, you do have a merciful heart.

08:36.090 --> 08:40.740
Well, that's a kind offer,
but I can hardly accept it.

08:40.770 --> 08:43.140
Then, die!

09:15.800 --> 09:17.440
I smell something.

09:17.470 --> 09:20.560
It's the smell of a woman.

09:21.180 --> 09:24.390
Even better, she is
young and a rare beauty.

09:25.100 --> 09:26.570
Are you one of the Kimon?

09:26.600 --> 09:28.990
Sexy voice.

09:29.020 --> 09:31.650
When you cry, it must
sound even more...

09:39.160 --> 09:42.450
Hand over the
Sacred Dragon Stone.

09:49.210 --> 09:51.670
Is that your rePW?

09:52.960 --> 09:54.960
Then this is my response to you.

10:21.200 --> 10:23.280
Karasemi trick.

10:24.120 --> 10:27.710
Well done, well performed.

10:30.250 --> 10:32.810
I will definitely make her mine.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.020
Listen.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.260
Find that woman!

12:36.880 --> 12:38.600
Where are you?

12:38.630 --> 12:39.840
I'm here!

12:57.060 --> 12:58.820
When taken, it
immediately works.

12:59.270 --> 13:01.860
My sword is
bitter to your taste.

13:14.250 --> 13:15.870
The powder touched her.

13:20.920 --> 13:22.310
I see.

13:22.340 --> 13:25.010
Someone took that Dragon Stone.

13:26.340 --> 13:28.270
Ohh, that's too bad!

13:28.300 --> 13:30.720
Jubei has the other half.

13:32.060 --> 13:36.230
Is that Dragon Stone
such a precious thing?

14:20.310 --> 14:22.070
Take this!

14:46.010 --> 14:47.510
Oh, I see.

14:48.470 --> 14:52.010
A maiden's naked
body charmed by a tree.

14:55.470 --> 14:59.100
This is a beautiful sight.

15:01.770 --> 15:04.950
Trample beauty and defile her...

15:04.980 --> 15:09.110
It's a wonderful moment,
my ultimate pleasure.

15:46.900 --> 15:50.990
Are you awake, my
beautiful maiden?

16:28.400 --> 16:31.030
Forcing someone like
that, you are no gentleman.

16:31.740 --> 16:35.840
She is the one who
controls the roots.

16:35.870 --> 16:39.370
And you with a burning
desire have the Stone.

16:40.580 --> 16:43.920
Give it back to me! The Stone!

16:46.380 --> 16:47.750
Just as I thought.

17:34.880 --> 17:38.260
I was getting tired
of waiting, Kitsunebi.

17:42.560 --> 17:44.430
Only half.

17:45.100 --> 17:46.360
Well, that's fine.

17:46.390 --> 17:48.560
Everything starts from now.

17:58.910 --> 18:02.620
If I turn around to the
leeward, I can smell him.

18:06.910 --> 18:10.880
How funny, the one I have to
chase at dawn is the fireball guy!

18:23.430 --> 18:26.310
I got it! I got his smell.

18:28.190 --> 18:31.200
Listen, learn his scent well.

18:31.230 --> 18:33.440
He is a tall man
of about six feet.

18:33.730 --> 18:35.230
Go!

18:41.870 --> 18:42.870
Moths?

18:44.620 --> 18:45.910
Crap!

18:46.660 --> 18:49.040
The reason he turned
around to the leeward was this.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.970
It is daybreak.

18:54.000 --> 18:56.350
Let's leave these woods for now.

18:56.380 --> 18:59.770
Hey, hey, what are we going to
do about that Treasure Stone?

18:59.800 --> 19:02.850
For now, we have no
choice but to trust him.

19:03.390 --> 19:05.440
That QUY?

19:05.470 --> 19:07.190
He will come back.

19:07.220 --> 19:09.070
I wonder.

19:09.100 --> 19:11.490
You have a better idea?

19:11.520 --> 19:14.690
Ohh... I don't know.

19:15.610 --> 19:16.690
JubeL...

19:21.820 --> 19:23.370
<i>Sleeping potion?</i>

19:24.780 --> 19:26.200
<i>If it goes on like this...</i>

19:31.830 --> 19:34.540
<i>A smell of sulfur... Well, then!</i>

19:43.720 --> 19:46.720
You can't get
away from my trick.

19:59.780 --> 20:01.860
After all, they
are only insects.

20:03.110 --> 20:07.410
What are you
doing? Go! Go to him!

20:08.120 --> 20:12.370
You are on the leeward,
and I'm on the windward.

20:13.290 --> 20:14.800
This is the pit of hell.

20:14.830 --> 20:17.920
Even birds avoid
flying over here.

20:19.380 --> 20:21.130
Is that so?

20:31.770 --> 20:34.870
But I have this one.

20:34.900 --> 20:36.360
Go!

20:52.620 --> 20:53.750
What?

21:03.260 --> 21:05.800
Damn you!

21:38.830 --> 21:43.090
Half the Dragon Stone is in
the hands of someone else now.

21:44.590 --> 21:46.350
Half doesn't mean a thing.

21:46.380 --> 21:48.260
The two halves make one.

23:32.950 --> 23:34.950
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:36.290 --> 23:40.840
With his humongous sword, Zampa
of the Kimon Clan attacks Jubei.

23:40.870 --> 23:47.060
Tsubute, who took a chance and
got the Dragon Stone, runs downtown.

23:47.090 --> 23:48.810
On the way there, he
meets Tatsunosuke,

23:48.840 --> 23:51.560
a young boy with an astonishing
revelation about himself.

23:51.590 --> 23:55.610
Where would this strange friendship
born between the two of them go?

23:55.640 --> 23:59.950
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Diamond Child.

23:59.980 --> 24:01.700
<i>Episode 5 Diamond Child Witness.</i>

24:01.730 --> 24:02.900
<i>Episode 5 Diamond Child</i>
